 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It's not ideal, and it would make some people sad. Then enjoy it without going too big. Keep it simple, and never leave the trails. Generally, no cooking, and always ask before doing anything. Keep it quiet. Many people visit cemeteries at peace, and you don't want to ruin that. Also, think about how you'd feel if someone did this at your loved one's headstone. Would you be happy, or sad?",
